    "instructions": "For every A2UI createSurface message, set catalogId to \"restage:catalog/sha256/ca2df5a68793193fdbeddbfbe628902b64f3f49f885fb43a49e1d31c246dc777\".\nCallout: Use for a short highlighted aside around optional content.\nCallout constructor fields: message => props_message, detail => props_detail.\nComparisonPanel: A headed panel with an introduction, examples, and conclusion.\nComparisonPanel constructor fields: heading => props_heading, introduction => props_introduction, examples => props_examples, conclusion => props_conclusion.\nQuizCheck: A prompt with a checkable answer bound to a boolean value.\nQuizCheck constructor fields: prompt => props_prompt, selected => props_selected.\nSectionHeader: A titled section header.\nSectionHeader constructor fields: title => props_title.\nCtaButton: A call-to-action button that dispatches a tap event.\nCtaButton constructor fields: label => props_label.\nIntegerListPicker: Adds values to a bound integer list.\nIntegerListPicker constructor fields: selected => props_selected.\nProductCard: Renders a structured product (nested price, tags, features, attributes, size).\nProductCard constructor fields: product => props_product.\nRatingPicker: A 1–5 star rating control bound to an integer value.\nRatingPicker constructor fields: rating => props_rating.\nScalarListPanel: Renders string, integer, number, and boolean lists.\nScalarListPanel constructor fields: labels => props_labels, counts => props_counts, weights => props_weights, measurements => props_measurements, flags => props_flags, maybeCounts => props_maybeCounts, fallbackCounts => props_fallbackCounts.",
